Keeps astrometricslib/libraryIndex/ present in a fresh checkout.

Everything else in this directory is runtime state and is gitignored
(astrometrics.db, astrometrics_log.db, locks/, calibration_frames.json).
Without this placeholder the directory would not exist after a clone, and
AppConfiguration.get_library_path() resolves "path = ./libraryIndex" by
testing whether <root>/astrometricslib/libraryIndex exists -- falling back
to <root>/libraryIndex when it does not. Deleting this file therefore does
not just remove an empty directory, it silently moves the image library to
a different location.
